SUMMARY:MST: Blackstock Knob\, mile-high hike
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nThis is one of the most beautiful 
 hikes along the MST in WNC. It starts in a light-filled hardwood forest an
 d works it way up to a dark conifer forest full of spruce/fir\, mosses\, a
 nd ferns. Helene has cleared the top at Blackstock Knob\, which offers goo
 d long-range views.\n\n**THIS IS A DARN TOUGH HIKE**. It starts at 5\,400 
 ft.\, climbs to 6\,200 ft.\, descends to 5\,800 ft. at Rainbow Gap\, and t
 hen climbs to 6\,300 ft to Blackstock Knob. **It's 7 miles round trip**. T
 he first 2 miles are through the Rock Pile\, after which the trails become
 s a bit easier. After our break at the top\, we return to the Rock Pile. N
 ot a dog friendly hike.\n\n**THIS IS A CAR POOL**. Parking is severely lim
 ited at the trail head\, which is at the road up to Mt. Mitchell\, NC 128.
  We will meet at the Folk Art Center\, lower parking lot.\n\nIt takes 50-6
 0 minutes to reach the trail head\, 3 1/2 to 4 hrs. to hike\, 50-60 minute
 s to return. Total time: 5 1/2 to 6 hrs. **Speed limit on the BRP is now 3
 5 mph.**\n\nI'm subbing for Craig. FYI.\n\n**Release of Liability:**\nThe 
 organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide. The fu
 nction of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign up or p
 articipate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily a
 gree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages arising fro
 m\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In addition\, you ack
 nowledge that you agree to the Meetup Terms of Service: [https://help.meet
 up.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-436
 1-8afc-854a4f586c82.](https://help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/articles/3600274472
 52-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82.)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315793109
 /
